direction: right
Customer: Customer {shape: person}
Orders: Order service {shape: rectangle}
OrderDB: Order database {shape: cylinder}
Events: Event broker {shape: queue}
Inventory: Inventory service {shape: rectangle}
Payments: Payment service {shape: rectangle}
Shipping: Shipping service {shape: rectangle}
Notifications: Notification service {shape: rectangle}
DeadLetters: Dead-letter queue {shape: queue}
Customer -> Orders: place order
Orders -> OrderDB: create pending
Orders -> Events: OrderCreated
Events -> Inventory: reserve stock
Inventory -> Events: InventoryReserved
Events -> Payments: authorize payment
Payments -> Events: PaymentAuthorized
Events -> Shipping: arrange shipment
Shipping -> Events: ShipmentCreated
Events -> Orders: complete order
Events -> Notifications: notify customer
Inventory -> Events: InventoryRejected
Payments -> Events: PaymentFailed
Events -> Inventory: release reservation
Events -> Orders: cancel order
Events -> DeadLetters: unhandled event
